#: ../../source/docs/modules/auxopt.rst:3 8ca09bd4ab554fa5afcca23c5e2bc240
msgid "Auxiliary (RC 6,7, ...) Options"
msgstr "辅助通道（RC 6、7……）选项"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/auxopt.rst:9 5c7e79728f5f4b2bad45293024bed101
msgid ""
"Allows the user to change the action mapped to RC channels 7 and 8 on "
"APM:Copter."
msgstr "允许用户更改 APM:Copter 上 RC 通道 7 和 8 映射的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/auxopt.rst:12 628e145bcb804a0294ae402643ea99d0
msgid ""
"Use ``auxopt list`` and ``auxopt show`` to show a list of available actions "
"for the RC channels and their current setting respectively."
msgstr "使用 ``auxopt list`` 和 ``auxopt show`` 分别显示 RC 通道可用功能列表及其当前设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/auxopt.rst:15 f2457336b33b46a38b75dedad3140d86
msgid ""
"Use ``auxopt set [ch] [action]`` and ``auxopt reset`` to set and reset the "
"action mapped to the RC channels respectively."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``auxopt set [ch] [action]`` 和 ``auxopt reset`` 分别设置和重置 RC 通道映射的功能。"
